# Tests

- **Scope**: Unit and integration tests using pytest.
- **Non-Goals**: Performance benchmarks (separate if needed), UI tests.

## Rules

- Arrange-Act-Assert structure. Prefer explicit fixtures.
- Use in-memory infra adapters by default. Avoid hidden global state.
- Assert on precise outcomes; include IDs and counts in failure messages.

